# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# verification harness output — screenshots and JSON the verify/ scripts emit.
# Regenerated on every run and worth ~800K a session; the SCRIPTS are the record
# worth keeping, not their output. The `/out/` rule above is root-anchored and
# does not cover this path.
verify/out/

# Undecided brand-asset candidates — Carl, 17 September 2026: *"I may or may not
# use them. There is no need for them to be tracked but i will keep them on my PC
# for now."* Kept on disk, out of version control, and out of every `git status`.
#
# ⚠ THREE EXACT PATHS, NOT THE FOLDER. `brand-assets/` is heavily TRACKED — it
# holds the logo masters, the DaVinci sources and `about-studio-wall-cards-1800.jpg`,
# the plate the About wall cards were transferred FROM. Ignoring the directory
# would be wrong; these three are named individually on purpose.
#
# ⛔ REVERSIBLE BY DESIGN. If one of these is later chosen, delete its line here
# and `git add` it — nothing else is needed. Ignoring never deleted anything.
#
# ⛔ ONE WAS CHOSEN, AND ITS ABSENCE BROKE EVERY DEPLOYMENT FOR FIVE DAYS — Carl,
# 8 October 2026 ("Option 1"). `c2b-logo-gold-relit-alpha-1671.png` became the
# gold TARGET the desk mark was traced from, and `components/about/logo-bench.tsx`
# IMPORTS it (since 6302913, 3 October). Ignored, it was on this PC only: every
# local build passed and every Vercel build failed ("Module not found") — 12
# commits, three Vercel projects each, live site frozen at 67da4ef. Its line is
# removed and the file tracked. ⚠ A local build cannot catch an import of an
# untracked file; a build of a CLEAN checkout (git archive + npm ci) can.
# The source PNG and the Gemini image are still unchosen and stay ignored.
brand-assets/Gemini_Generated_Image_v709qev709qev709.jpg
brand-assets/logo/c2b-logo-gold-relit-source-1671.png
